1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
Productivity comes from all the things

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,560
that you choose not to do.

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:06,480
I see commitment as the elimination of alternatives.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:09,160
If I get married, then I eliminate all alternatives

5
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,680
to the person that I'm married to, right?

6
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:13,800
That is commitment, which is very similar to focus.

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,880
If you think about the hypothetical extreme of focus

8
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:18,080
is that somebody does literally nothing but one thing.

9
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,480
So they don't eat, they don't sleep,

10
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,480
they would eventually die.

11
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,000
But they would be 100% focused

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,340
during the time that they were alive.

13
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:24,880
Obviously we have to put a couple things in,

14
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:26,840
you have to eat food, you have to sleep, right?

15
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,520
But the most focused person

16
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,320
does the fewest things outside

17
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,920
of the thing they're focused on.

